"finden sie im Meta Werbeanzeigenmanager neben dem Kontonamen."

#: front-end/ad-platforms/views/page.php:180
msgid ""
"Enter your Google Ads customer ID manually if it is not listed above. Digits "
"only, no dashes. You can find it at the top-right of your Google Ads account."
